# French catalogue of Google Hub (daemon, Gemini drawer and Shell extension), domain "google-hub".
# Compiled by install.sh into the extension (locale/) and next to the daemon and the drawer
# (~/.local/share/google-hub/locale). Sources: po/POTFILES.
