msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: google-hub\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://github.com/maximeallanic/gnome-google-hub/"
"issues\n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-10-20 14:38+0200\n"
